{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_026_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80921d109ec3c58de1aa65aa6f18f9043bc53f700e0fcaddbbc6a0fe9dac491d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10c602ec35b948be5acf1fb330bdf59199c023942804634a1a491d787ecfbf6e",
      "text": "讲义气男子的休息日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98a20f44807048ffbab7ce438a7f9f8c7ecabf7fa6691e18e65a8e0a6b0ffe2c",
      "text": "玄武有事想拜托制作人。\n那个请求是，想给曾经受其照顾的福利院\n换一批新玩具，希望能陪他一起去挑。\n下一个休息日，两人动身前往玄武挑选的玩具店……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10c602ec35b948be5acf1fb330bdf59199c023942804634a1a491d787ecfbf6e",
      "text": "讲义气男子的休息日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72506beb365818a0ef712dbc5d8db06b2fe14e23cd379a48a9839a4ff1955612",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，能耽误你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43d3c6fba2a390611692f44454ed61c5a94943c96d930f78af693e4101b1ce86",
      "text": "好的，有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:209fe8983ed2c6b3222f739b38f99adbe022a69488e605bf5eece265debd49d5",
      "text": "实不相瞒……我看重番长的本事，想拜托你一件事。\n是件重要的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f500dc18c6ba05c2ffd3d67c8774ed2b73c0aa531748ab2e59dada63c45929b5",
      "text": "重要的事，吗？\n要、要是我能帮上忙，请尽管吩咐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8527df2fdcc5f7b3f9a80a1b1cc349e198cbf3ee450c8ec6e81573a6cd7cae9",
      "text": "（能让玄武先生说到这个份上，\n到底发生什么事了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a1cb39a4f99d59c273bcbcd4790960932ff4b2e2963110b2936351d6465d344",
      "text": "实际上，我曾受其照顾的福利院里的玩具，\n已经变得相当破旧了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75748e10a8bb8e070e4ed67c8a72aa3bf0b92cf424956c7c638080b97c5676ae",
      "text": "为了把它们换成新的，\n能陪我去买一趟吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4a9c3bbb826b9d2ae947468b6cb02001671159497b829a7fef5b1df90097481",
      "text": "平时我都是一个人去买的，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00bafcd3e317952483f58d9dc0b164f6dc34a2e6dbf7463f08d18bb169fd8755",
      "text": "光是我选的东西，\n难免千篇一律。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acecfbc26dc4d54afdfc6f972b003d3ddb2617f2ece890308c40486033ffab31",
      "text": "原来是这样。如果是这种事请包在我身上。\n不过，为什么找我……？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
